      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "野生寶可夢為了活下去而偷人類的食物，\n我也不是不能理解，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但密阿雷是座和寶可夢共生的城市嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 1656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "91CE751F5BF653EF592270BA4E866D3B4E0B53BB800C50774EBA985E768498DF7269FF0C000A62114E5F4E0D662F4E0D80FD740689E3FF0C00100001BE00000A4F465BC6963F96F7662F5EA7548C5BF653EF59225171751F768457CE5E02561B300200100002011401C70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "多虧了這位訓練家，\n小毒電看來要交到朋友了！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n真是謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 1764,
